message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below (and the paper once it has a DOI)."
title: "Certified circle packings and an exact autocorrelation verifier"
type: software
version: "1.0"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23051520
date-released: "2026-09-30"
authors:
  - family-names: "López Preciado"
    given-names: "Elian Alfonso"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
    location: "León, Guanajuato, México"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/elianalfonsolopezpreciado/certified-packings"
abstract: >-
  Search code, an independent exact verifier, a third-party .pck validator, certificates and logs for maximum sum-of-radii circle packings
  (two packings for n=120 and n=250 exceed the Packomania csqv values listed on 2026-09-29 21:32 UTC-6; the table changes quickly) and for the first
  autocorrelation inequality (exact verification up to N=38,400; best certified bound 1.505274644, not a record).
keywords:
  - circle packing
  - sum of radii
  - packomania
  - autocorrelation inequality
  - exact verification
  - certificates
